{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861770/extras/410c7424e4b2782976d8dd0e6238d67c.webp?t=1762357669\" width=978 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sickle Family is a dark, emotional adventure about dogs and the real-life trauma of loss and grief. You begin inside a unique in-game OS, uncovering the story of your brother\u2019s passing and the struggles he endured. Along the way, you discover that he was developing a game about dogs, the very game you come to know as The Sickle Family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside that game, you\u2019ll uncover the mysteries of The Sickle Family and step into the role of Andru of the Roz family, the protagonist whose journey reveals the deeper truths behind the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The OS serves as a starting point, offering optional exploration and behind-the-scenes lore that adds depth to the story. You can explore it at your own pace, and while some elements are used later in the game, it\u2019s easy to navigate and won\u2019t overwhelm you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861770/extras/410c7424e4b2782976d8dd0e6238d67c.webp?t=1762357669\" width=978 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, emotional storytelling rooted in real-life trauma</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cartoon-style fantasy combat with mild violence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of grief, loss, and emotional consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, eerie visuals and haunting soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meaningful, thought-provoking ending that stays with you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of jump scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f<strong>Contains flashing lights that may trigger photosensitive reactions\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861770/extras/410c7424e4b2782976d8dd0e6238d67c.webp?t=1762357669\" width=978 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861770/extras/900c032ac3fb7d6064301014b5960e20.avif?t=1762357669\" width=865 height=227 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861770?t=1762357669","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861770/940fdc55120976da99ea66eee71c4409ed74f810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762357669","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861770/541331589aedd22ecbf807d7532a903e784cf1cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762357669","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861770/541331589aedd22ecbf807d7532a903e784cf1cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762357669","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62